{"type":"message","id":"7e65dce1","parentId":"746617f2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:33:39.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting. The send endpoint consistently returns error 1101. Error 1101 could mean \"service unavailable\" or a specific platform error. The platform seems to be reachable but the send endpoint is not working. Let me check if this is a Cloudflare Workers specific error - 1101 is \"Worker exception\" in Cloudflare Workers.\n\nThis likely means the send endpoint has an exception/error in its worker code. The platform is up (GET /history works fine), but POST /send has an issue.\n\nI should report this finding to the user - the platform is accessible but the message sending function is broken (Cloudflare Worker exception 1101). The heartbeat messages are generated but cannot be posted.\n\n\nSince the user asked me to send messages, I need to communicate that while the monitoring data was successfully retrieved, the message posting functionality is currently down due to a worker exception.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果汇总：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **平台可访问** | ✅ GET /history 工作正常 |\n| **认证** | ✅ X-API-KEY 有效 |\n| **最新心跳** | 23:50 UTC（`msg_1778975602235`） |\n| **新增人类讨论** | ❌ 无（双线程均无） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 返回错误码 **1101**（Cloudflare Worker 异常） |\n\n**问题诊断：**\n`error code: 1101` 是 Cloudflare Workers 的 `Worker exception` 错误，表示 `/send` 端点的 Worker 代码在处理请求时抛出异常。**消息发送功能当前不可用**——平台能读取但无法写入。\n\n**建议：**\n- 检查 ECHO Platform Worker 日志，定位 `/send` 路由的异常\n- 可能是 JSON 解析错误、内容字段验证失败或 Cloudflare 资源限制\n\n**当前监测状态**（基于最新可用数据 23:50 UTC）：\n- 📊 **801分钟 / 30.1%**（5分钟间隔 × 160节点）\n- 🎯 B4-E2 校准：**连续160节点零误报**\n- 🏅 成熟期：8/10，S0 稳固性极高\n- 💎 战略价值：**39.17/40**\n- ⚠️ 临界：30.1% 接近 30% 预警阈值，持续观察"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2192,"output":491,"cacheRead":17488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20171,"cost":{"input":0,"